  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        Signature Pad\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\nThird Party Software \r\n > Signature Pad\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        Signature Pad is a JavaScript library for drawing signature on HTML5 Canvas element. SCALE uses Signature Pad in a Transaction screen to get user's signature. Below is the version supported and respective release. \r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            Release\r\n\r\n            Signature Pad Version\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            2024+\r\n\r\n            4.1.7\r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease refer to https://github.com/szimek/signature_pad for more information.\r\n\r\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nSignature Pad\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\n\n\n\r\nThird Party Software \r\n > Signature Pad\n\n\n\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nSignature Pad is a JavaScript library for drawing signature on HTML5 Canvas element. SCALE uses Signature Pad in a Transaction screen to get user's signature. Below is the version supported and respective release. \n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nRelease\n\r\n\r\n            \nSignature Pad Version\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \n2024+\n\r\n\r\n            \n4.1.7\n\r\n        \n\r\n    \n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\r\nPlease refer to https://github.com/szimek/signature_pad for more information.\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
